OL,3,APolice did not collude with Robert
OL,4,AHamill attackers, inquiry finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquiry into the sectarian murder of
OL,7,FRobert Hamill has found police officers
OL,8,Fwho were in a vehicle near the attack
OL,9,Fdid not condone or collude with the
OL,10,Fattackers.
OL,12,FThe report, published on Monday,
OL,13,Fhighlighted multiple wrongful omissions
OL,14,Fin the subsequent murder investigation
OL,15,Fincluding a failure to properly search
OL,16,Fthe home of a key suspect.
OL,18,FRobert Hamill was 25 when he died after
OL,19,Fhe was beaten by loyalists in
OL,20,FPortadown, County Armagh in 1997.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
