OL,3,APolice did not collude with Robert
OL,4,AHamill attackers, inquiry finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inquiry concluded in 2009 and its
OL,7,Freport was completed in 2011 but the
OL,8,Ffindings could not be published until
OL,9,Fthree prosecutions in connection with
OL,10,Fthe case concluded.
